{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06455","headline":"魏仓曹宅各赋一物得当轩石竹 · 李颀","name":"魏仓曹宅各赋一物得当轩石竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罗生殊衆色，独爲表华滋。\n虽杂蕙兰处，无争桃李时。\n同人趋府暇，落日後庭期。\n密叶散红点，灵条惊紫蕤。\n芳菲看不厌，采摘愿来兹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}